@TrustService.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5079
@token = Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Get all trusts
GET {{TrustService.API_HostAddress}}/api/trusts
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get active trusts
GET {{TrustService.API_HostAddress}}/api/trusts/active
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get trust by code
GET {{TrustService.API_HostAddress}}/api/trusts/T01
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get trusts via Dapper
GET {{TrustService.API_HostAddress}}/api/trusts/dapper?statusFilter=A
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

### Create a trust
POST {{TrustService.API_HostAddress}}/api/trusts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "trustCode": "T03",
  "trustShortName": "New Test Trust",
  "trustType": "PF3",
  "trustStartDate": "2026-01-01T00:00:00",
  "addressLine1": "789 Test Street",
  "city": "Bangalore",
  "state": "Karnataka",
  "pinCode": "560001",
  "country": "India",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### Close a trust
POST {{TrustService.API_HostAddress}}/api/trusts/T03/close
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

"2026-12-31T00:00:00"

### Minimal API - Get all trusts
GET {{TrustService.API_HostAddress}}/api/minimal/trusts
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

### Health check
GET {{TrustService.API_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###
